ed.</p></fn><fn id="t4-fn3"><label>b</label><p>The patient presented with metastatic seminoma and was treated with chemotherapy and radiotherapy alone. He had limited TM of the right testis and scant TM in the left. The testicular primary was never established in this patient.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>